.SH NAME
gyro-container-notifications-get - Notification settings and current alerts


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgyro container notifications get  [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Notification settings and current alerts

.PP
\fBsettings\fR (channels, events, cooldown; the webhook secret is never returned), \fBconditions\fR = what is wrong right now, \fBhistory\fR = last 30 alerts. Events: down (no ready replica for >3 min), crashloop (keeps restarting / image pull fails / out of memory), replicas_low (below alerts.min_ready), scale_max (autoscaling wants more than max), capacity (replicas wait for room in the node pool), egress (the egress IPs of the environment changed; one message, no resolved). An event is announced after ~2 minutes, at most once per cooldown per service + event (flapping included), with a 'resolved' message.

.PP
API: GET /cloud/containers/{id}/notifications (operationId typed_get_containers\fBid\fPnotifications, scope services_read)


